<h1>BL Music Player - Privacy Policy</h1>
<p>Last updated: November 2026</p>

<h2>Overview</h2>
<p>BL Music Player is a music player that plays audio files stored on your device. Your privacy matters to us.</p>

<h2>Permissions</h2>
<p>The app asks for permission to read audio files on your device (to list and play your music) and to show notifications (for playback controls). Your music, playlists and favorites stay on your device. We do not upload, collect or share them.</p>

<h2>Advertising</h2>
<p>The app shows ads using Google AdMob. AdMob may collect and use your advertising ID, IP address and device information to serve and measure ads. For details see Google's Privacy Policy: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">policies.google.com/privacy</a>. In the European Economic Area and the UK, we ask for your consent before showing personalized ads. You can reset your advertising ID or opt out of personalization in your device settings.</p>

<h2>Data we collect</h2>
<p>We do not collect personal information ourselves. Data processed by AdMob is handled by Google under its own policy.</p>

<h2>Children</h2>
<p>The app is not directed to children under 13.</p>

<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>We may update this policy from time to time. The latest version will always be available on this page.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>Email: <b>kitchigo634@gmail.com</b></p>
</body>
